# Build output: the whole app bundle, the test binaries and the diagnostic tools land here.
# Everything is reproducible from source with `make`.
build/

# Probe output and the pid of the run that produced it. The probe source itself
# (spike/probe.m) is tracked; its output is not.
spike/out.txt
spike/pid
spike/probe.app/

# Finder noise on a macOS box.
.DS_Store

# Editor and merge leftovers.
*.swp
*~
*.orig
*.rej

# Working notes from the macOS 26 menu bar investigation: the question set and the
# replies to it. They are a record of one debugging session, not project
# documentation, and the finding they produced is written up in README.md instead.
questions.md
*answer*.md
